// VALIDATION: Resistive voltage divider (component network)
// AREA: Component modeling - electrical
// BASIS: Equal resistors split the source: V_mid = E * R2/(R1+R2) = 5 V.
// EXPECT v_mid = 5 tol 1e-9
VoltageSource VS(E=10)
Resistor R1(R=100)
Resistor R2(R=100)
Ground G()
connect(VS.p, R1.a)
connect(R1.b, R2.a)
connect(R2.b, VS.n, G.port)
v_mid = R1.b.V
